msgid "Typed factory, static instances and polymorphic faces"
msgstr "类型化 factory、静态实例与多态接口面"

msgid ""
"The current platform keeps typed factory lookup and C polymorphism. "
"Configuration generates the exact instances; factory lookup returns them "
"without constructing, initializing, locking or discovering anything. "
"Hardware startup and request execution are separate explicit actions."
msgstr ""
"当前平台保留类型化工厂查找和 C 多态。配置生成精确实例；factory 查找只返回它们，不构造、初始化、加锁或探测。硬件启动和请求执行是各自显式动作。"

msgid ""
"![Current factory IDs, shared readonly ops and independent instance "
"contexts](../assets/diagrams/factory-instances.svg)"
msgstr ""
"![当前 factory ID、共享只读 ops 与独立实例上下文](../assets/diagrams/factory-instances.svg)"

msgid ""
"Current factory IDs, shared readonly ops and independent instance contexts"
msgstr "当前 factory ID、共享只读 ops 与独立实例上下文"

#: docs/explanation/factory.md:18
msgid ""
"FIG-04 shows the current identity structure. A controller and a child "
"endpoint have different interfaces and IDs even when their implementation "
"shares a physical bus."
msgstr "FIG-04 表示当前身份结构。控制器与子端点有不同接口和 ID，即使实现共享同一物理总线。"

msgid "What generation owns"
msgstr "生成器拥有的责任"

msgid ""
"One schema-2 TOML selects instance names, bindings, modes and exact "
"capacities. The strict resolver produces typed IR; emitters publish readonly"
" faces, shared ops references, private independent contexts, fixed IRQ "
"wiring and compact getters. Native assemblies receive independent model "
"state too; a test singleton is not the production instance-generation "
"mechanism."
msgstr ""
"一份 schema-2 TOML 选择实例名、绑定、模式和精确容量。严格解析器产生类型化 IR；生成器发布只读接口面、共享 ops "
"引用、独立私有上下文、固定 IRQ 接线和紧凑获取函数。Native 装配同样取得独立模型状态；测试单例不是生产实例生成机制。"

msgid "What a call does"
msgstr "一次调用执行什么"

msgid "Action"
msgstr "动作"

msgid "Work performed"
msgstr "实际工作"

msgid "`nx_factory_uart(id)`"
msgstr "`nx_factory_uart(id)`"

msgid "Select and return an existing readonly UART face"
msgstr "选择并返回已有只读 UART 接口面"

msgid "`nx_platform_start()`"
msgstr "`nx_platform_start()`"

msgid "Execute selected setup and retain cleanup outcomes"
msgstr "执行选定初始化，保留清理结果"

msgid "Public I/O operation"
msgstr "公共 I/O 操作"

msgid "Validate face, then dispatch `ops(context, ...)`"
msgstr "验证接口面，再分发 `ops(context, ...)`"

msgid "IRQ entry"
msgstr "IRQ 入口"

msgid "Access the fixed concrete provider and its owned hardware"
msgstr "访问固定具体提供者和其拥有的硬件"

msgid "Explicit service/wait"
msgstr "显式 service/wait"

msgid "Advance or observe the selected lifecycle"
msgstr "推进或观察选定生命周期"

msgid "Stop"
msgstr "停止"

msgid "Close/drain according to contract; cannot revoke outstanding storage"
msgstr "按合同关闭/排空；不能提前收回仍在借用的存储"

msgid ""
"Products may retain a face for the provider-storage lifetime. Stopping "
"hardware does not revoke a pointer or synchronize callers. The application "
"must quiesce callers and publishers before reclaiming external adapter "
"storage. No getter changes mode or silently acquires execution ownership."
msgstr ""
"产品可在提供者存储生命周期内保留接口面。停止硬件不会撤销指针，也不会同步调用方。应用必须确保调用方与发布者停止访问并完成必要同步，才能回收外部 "
"adapter 存储。获取函数不改变模式或悄悄取得执行所有权。"

msgid "Verify the generated design"
msgstr "验证生成设计"

msgid ""
"This complete maintained assembly selects independent Native instances:"
msgstr "以下完整维护装配选择独立 Native 实例："

msgid ""
"Maintained generated factory fixture; its software Board is not a physical "
"PCB."
msgstr "维护中的生成 factory 夹具；其软件 Board 不是物理 PCB。"

msgid ""
"The [async tutorial](../tutorials/async-io.md) runs the complete generated "
"factory binary. It verifies cold lookup, distinct contexts with shared ops, "
"bus/endpoint identity, invalid IDs, stop/restart and retained quarantine. "
"The authority for these interfaces is the [integration "
"contract](../design/integration-contracts.md) and generated/public headers; "
"this page explains the design rather than duplicating function declarations."
msgstr ""
"[异步教程](../tutorials/async-io.md)运行完整生成 factory 可执行文件，验证冷态查找、共享 ops "
"下的独立上下文、总线/端点身份、无效 ID、停止/重启和隔离保留。这些接口的权威是[接入合同](../design/integration-"
"contracts.md)及生成/公开头文件；本页解释设计，不重复函数声明。"

#: docs/explanation/factory.md:29
msgid ""
"`nexus_factory.h` is generated for each Platform assembly, so its IDs are "
"not a universal header or persistent numbering scheme. Default IDs are "
"compact `uint16_t` aliases with named constants. COUNT, invalid and "
"unselected entries return NULL. A chip capability record does not grant "
"Board routing or physical qualification."
msgstr ""
"`nexus_factory.h` 针对每份 Platform 装配生成，因此其中的 ID 不是通用头或持久编号方案。默认 ID 是带具名常量的紧凑 "
"`uint16_t` 别名。COUNT、非法值和未选中的条目均返回 NULL。芯片能力记录不授予 Board 路由或实物资格。"

#: docs/explanation/factory.md:34
msgid "Choose strong references for new products"
msgstr "新产品优先使用强类型引用"

#: docs/explanation/factory.md:36
msgid ""
"Every Platform assembly emits `nexus_factory_strong.h`. New products should "
"include it and use the class-specific `NX_*_REF_*` constants with "
"`nx_factory_*_ref()` getters. These wrappers return the same static faces "
"and add no global storage, hardware access or configuration key."
msgstr ""
"每份 Platform 装配都会生成 `nexus_factory_strong.h`。新产品应包含该头文件，并将类别专用的 `NX_*_REF_*` "
"常量传给 `nx_factory_*_ref()` getter。这些包装返回相同的静态接口面，不增加全局存储、硬件访问或配置键。"

#: docs/explanation/factory.md:41
msgid ""
"Default scalar IDs remain assembly-local `uint16_t` aliases; C does not "
"reject mixing two such aliases. Nominal structure references let the "
"compiler reject that class mismatch. They do not authenticate an external "
"value or make an instance active. Optional capability records are separately"
" selected by `factory.capabilities`."
msgstr ""
"默认标量 ID 仍是装配局部的 `uint16_t` 别名，C "
"不会拒绝混用两个这样的别名。具有独立结构类型的引用可让编译器拒绝类别不匹配，但不认证外部数值，也不使实例进入活动状态。可选能力记录另外通过 "
"`factory.capabilities` 选择。"

#: docs/explanation/factory.md:47
msgid ""
"The factory header includes complete public APIs only for selected interface"
" classes and preserves forward declarations for unselected getters. Include "
"a specific public I/O header explicitly when code needs that API or its "
"complete face layout; an empty getter still returns NULL."
msgstr ""
"factory 头文件只为选中的接口类别包含完整公共 API，并为未选中的 getter 保留前置声明。代码需要特定 API "
"或完整接口面布局时，应显式包含对应公共 I/O 头；空 getter 仍返回 NULL。"
